##  Complexity Summary

| Program / Operation | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
| ------------------- | --------------: | ---------------: |
| Array Traversal     |            O(n) |             O(1) |
| 2D Array Traversal  |        O(n × m) |             O(1) |
| Insertion           |            O(n) |             O(1) |
| Deletion            |            O(n) |             O(1) |
| Searching           |            O(n) |             O(1) |
| Rotation            |            O(n) |             O(1) |
| Greatest Element    |            O(n) |             O(1) |

> **Note:** The space complexity above refers to the **extra/auxiliary space** used by the operation. The array itself requires `O(n)` or `O(n × m)` storage.

